# Seasoned Cryomancer: Bot1 discards Lightning Bolt and an Island. Only the nonland card counts (CR 603.12, "that many"
# nonland cards), so the reflexive ability takes up to one target: two Ornithopters are refused as more than it takes,
# and one is tapped and stunned while the other stays untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Black Lotus
Seasoned Cryomancer
Lightning Bolt
Brainstorm
Island
Island
Force of Will
Dark Ritual
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Seasoned Cryomancer.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Island)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand = Island; Brainstorm; Force of Will; Dark Ritual
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Counters.Stun = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Counters.Stun = 1
